OL,3,GNEWSADaughter of US actress sues
OL,4,Acharity cafe over dog ban
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe daughter of a 70s Hollywood star is
OL,7,Fsuing for the right to bring her dog
OL,8,Finto a Western Isles cafe.
OL,10,FClaire Kellerman has brought a case
OL,11,Fagainst the Bernera Community
OL,12,FAssociation (BCA), claiming she has
OL,13,Fbeen discriminated against. It is not
OL,14,Fclear if the animal is a support dog.
OL,16,FHer adoptive mother Sally Kellerman's
OL,17,Fportrayal of "Hot Lips" Houlihan in the
OL,18,FKorean war comedy drama film M*A*S*H
OL,19,Fearned Oscar and Golden Globe
OL,20,Fnominations.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
